{%- comment -%}
  The hero's play button: a crimson disc alone, centred in the hero in the empty room between its copy and the product
  (the copy's red lines end left of centre, every slide's product sits right of it). The hero itself is the film's
  poster: a click anywhere on it plays the film (assets/bizmis-film.js). Params: label (the button's name).
{%- endcomment -%}
<button type="button" class="hero-film-play" data-film-open aria-label="{{ label | escape }}">
  <span class="hero-film-play__disc" data-play aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="hero-film-play__ring"></span>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3"/></svg>
  </span>
</button>
